      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Section 1.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13713#sec1",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "80 FR 78117, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d768aeaf094226b3323629ac4615bb981f12b8b4b1e9e47d1e15f57144765ebd",
        "signing_date": "2015-12-11",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13713.txt",
        "text_sha256": "6f592fac01abd535546a84cc84e115bf996a1bccb8a6107188085930158db0b2",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2015-12-16/pdf/2015-31749.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. All executive branch departments and agencies of the Federal \nGovernment shall be closed and their employees excused from duty for \nthe last half of the scheduled workday on Thursday, December 24, 2015, \nthe day before Christmas Day, except as provided in section 2 of this \norder."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1553,
      "char_start": 1209,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13713#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13713#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "80 FR 78117, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d768aeaf094226b3323629ac4615bb981f12b8b4b1e9e47d1e15f57144765ebd",
        "signing_date": "2015-12-11",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13713.txt",
        "text_sha256": "6f592fac01abd535546a84cc84e115bf996a1bccb8a6107188085930158db0b2",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2015-12-16/pdf/2015-31749.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. The heads of executive branch departments and agencies may deter-\nmine that certain offices and installations of their organizations, or parts \nthereof, must remain open and that certain employees must remain on \nduty for the full scheduled workday on December 24, 2015, for reasons \nof national security, defense, or other public need."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1828,
      "char_start": 1555,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13713#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13713#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "80 FR 78117, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d768aeaf094226b3323629ac4615bb981f12b8b4b1e9e47d1e15f57144765ebd",
        "signing_date": "2015-12-11",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13713.txt",
        "text_sha256": "6f592fac01abd535546a84cc84e115bf996a1bccb8a6107188085930158db0b2",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2015-12-16/pdf/2015-31749.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Thursday, December 24, 2015, shall be considered as falling within \nthe scope of Executive Order 11582 of February 11, 1971, and of 5 U.S.C. \n5546 and 6103(b) and other similar statutes insofar as they relate to the \npay and leave of employees of the United States."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1958,
      "char_start": 1830,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13713#sec4",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 4.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13713#sec4",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "80 FR 78117, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d768aeaf094226b3323629ac4615bb981f12b8b4b1e9e47d1e15f57144765ebd",
        "signing_date": "2015-12-11",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13713.txt",
        "text_sha256": "6f592fac01abd535546a84cc84e115bf996a1bccb8a6107188085930158db0b2",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2015-12-16/pdf/2015-31749.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. The Director of the Office of Personnel Management shall take \nsuch actions as may be necessary to implement this order."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2106,
      "char_start": 1960,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13713#sec5",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 5.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13713#sec5",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "80 FR 78117, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d768aeaf094226b3323629ac4615bb981f12b8b4b1e9e47d1e15f57144765ebd",
        "signing_date": "2015-12-11",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13713.txt",
