      },
      "text": "(ii) the functions of the Director of the Office of Management and Budget \nrelating to budgetary, administrative, or legislative proposals. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 10:38 Dec 15, 2015 Jkt 238001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\16DEE0.SGM 16DEE0jstallworth on DSK7TPTVN1PROD with PRES DOC\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n78118 Federal Register / Vol. 80, No. 241 / Wednesday, December 16, 2015 / Presidential Documents"
    },
